  "title": "Unified Title",
  "summary": "Both PopPert and SCALE address the challenge of predicting transcriptional responses from unpaired single-cell populations, leveraging population-level joint distribution modeling and conditional transport to enable perturbation-specific predictions across different types of perturbations. arXiv AI presents M$^3$-Gen as a novel framework for generating gene expression profiles from biomedical data, while arXiv Computer Vision highlights WSI-based gene-expression prediction and its clinical validation. Both studies focus on improving multimodal data integration and model interpretability.",
