      "link": "https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-11088-0",
      "description": "<p>Nature, Published online: 30 September 2026; <a href=\"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-11088-0\">doi:10.1038/s41586-026-11088-0</a></p>A strategy for functional G-protein-coupled receptor (GPCR) antagonism through bispecific antibody-mediated endocytosis and lysosomal degradation is reported.",
